# TECHNICAL STAND-UP

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Technical Stand-Up is a combat-specific movement used to safely transition from the ground to a standing fighting position while maintaining visual awareness, defensive capability and balance.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational movement for combat sports and self-defense.

---

# Philosophy

Getting back to your feet is a skill.

Standing up carelessly exposes the athlete to strikes, takedowns and loss of positional control.

The Technical Stand-Up teaches efficient, protected transitions from ground to standing.

CAS selects this exercise whenever ground transition ability is a priority.

